== (C2) contracting Conway map m=3: g = x/3, (2x+1)/3, (4x+1)/3 ==
   prod p_i = 8 < 27, max p_i = 4 < 9; Chernoff rate I(g) = 0.25130 (base 3), i.e. exponent 1 - I = 0.74870
   residue-word bijection mod 3^k, k <= 7: True
